		(property "NOTE" "128Mbit quad SPI, SOIC-8 208mil. The XC7A35T bitstream is 17,536,096 bits, so the previous W25Q80BV (8Mbit) could not boot the part at all. 128Mbit leaves ~14MB for user data above the bitstream."
